    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waifu World is a relaxing puzzle game where you need to swap the bricks to unlock the pictures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with one hand and unlock all pictures in a very short time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit, so you can enjoy and relax playing the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can finish the level quickly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the gallery with 1 hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gallery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on picture to enjoy all beautiful pictures in full screen </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arts by Niliuchahui</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140750/extras/3534e4c1d0f0f9ecba2a67b6b8fcabaa.avif?t=1727950373\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140750/extras/2ca2b97f2685dfed368a6788b3bcda65.avif?t=1727950373\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waifu World is a relaxing puzzle game where you need to swap the bricks to unlock the pictures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with one hand and unlock all pictures in a very short time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit, so you can enjoy and relax playing the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can finish the level quickly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the gallery with 1 hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheat Mode</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gallery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on picture to enjoy all beautiful pictures in full screen </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arts by Niliuchahui</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140750/extras/3534e4c1d0f0f9ecba2a67b6b8fcabaa.avif?t=1727950373\" data-has-big width=800 height=449 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140750/extras/2ca2b97f2685dfed368a6788b3bcda65.avif?t=1727950373\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
